flowchart TD
  A[Authorize and validate] --> B[Claim idempotency key in transaction]
  B --> C[Write transaction and items]
  C --> D[Write payments and ledger entries]
  D --> E[Write applicable lots and inbound movements]
  E --> F[Commit]
  C -. write failure .-> G[Roll back transaction]
  D -. write failure .-> G
  E -. write failure .-> G
